title: "Live log watching"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: idle
  s1: directory
  s2: idle_off
  s3: tracking
  s4: rotating
  s5: syncing
  s6: backoff
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: watch directory
  s0 --> s2: watch off
  s0 --> s3: view or import newest log
  s1 --> s0: restore durable watch
  s1 --> s2: watch off or no writes until deadline
  s1 --> s3: view or import newest log
  s1 --> s4: newer log appears
  s2 --> s0: restore durable watch
  s2 --> s3: view or import newest log
  s3 --> s2: watch off or no writes until deadline
  s3 --> s5: appended data or pending replay
  s3 --> s4: newer log appears
  s4 --> s0: restore durable watch
  s4 --> s3: new log import finishes or restore durable watch
  s4 --> s6: sync fails or ingest busy
  s4 --> s2: watch off or no writes until deadline
  s5 --> s3: restore durable watch or current sync finishes or view or import newest log
  s5 --> s6: sync fails or ingest busy
  s5 --> s2: watch off or no writes until deadline
  s6 --> s0: restore durable watch
  s6 --> s1: backoff expires
  s6 --> s2: watch off or no writes until deadline
  s6 --> s3: view or import newest log or restore durable watch or backoff expires
